## Test strategy

Jest + Testing Library for: the data validator (task 1/7), route rendering and `notFound()`
behavior (task 2/3), JSON-LD-matches-rendered-content (task 4), sitemap merge (task 5), the
`llms.txt` route (task 6) — all colocated in `__tests__/` per repo convention. Lighthouse CI
(task 8) is its own verification, run locally once and then continuously in CI; it is not a Jest
test.

## Definition of Done

Repo DoD (lint, type-check, build, test green; single PR; review passed) plus:
- All 5 competitor pages render with distinct, validated content; unknown slug 404s on the
  marketing surface.
- `sitemap.ts` and `llms.txt` both list all 5 URLs with zero manual sitemap edits beyond task 5's
  one-time block.
- JSON-LD on each page validates against schema.org's required fields for all three types, and
  the FAQ schema's questions match what's rendered.
- `npm run lighthouse:ci` passes locally against a production build for all 6 URLs.
